{
  "id": "resolve-speech-local",
  "title": "resolveSpeech answers on the device from tts_audio; with nothing generated every pair is pending (C-31)",
  "covers": [
    "speech.resolve_local"
  ],
  "narrative": [
    "One kana-only word (うっかり) without audio of its own. Setup of SHELL.md 8.2: the server runs no worker, the phone's tts_audio table is empty and no speech resolver runs, so nothing is ever ready on either side.",
    "Step 0: a text item is pending with source tts and the text echoed. retry_after_ms is ignored: the phone's value depends on connectivity (SHELL.md 4.3 resolveSpeech), the server's on its backlog.",
    "Step 1: a note_id resolves to the note's speech pair (pending); an unknown note is none. urgent is accepted.",
    "Step 2: duplicate pairs are answered alike; an explicit voice equal to the default is the same pair.",
    "Steps 3-4: text together with note_id, and voice together with note_id, are 422 at the item.",
    "Step 5: more than 20 urgent items are 422 at /urgent. Step 6: an empty items list is 422.",
    "On the phone the pairs go to the native resolver queue instead of a server job; that queue is not observable through the API and not part of parity."
  ],
  "clock_ms": 1795168800000,
  "device_id": "01931f3e-0000-7000-8000-0000000000d4",
